From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Israel Cueto <github@bumblecito.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:14:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] realtek: add SFP quirk for ODI DFP-34X-2C3

Add a quirk for the ODI DFP-34X-2C3 XPON SFP module.

The module supports 2500Base-X. Register it with the existing
sfp_quirk_2500basex quirk so the SFP driver recognizes this
specific module.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Israel Cueto <github@bumblecito.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/phy/sfp.c
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/sfp.c
@@ -616,6 +616,9 @@
 	// 1000BASE-LX / 1300MBd in its EEPROM
 	SFP_QUIRK("HSGQ", "HSGQ-XPON-Stick", sfp_quirk_2500basex,
 		  sfp_fixup_ignore_tx_fault),
+
+       /* ODI DFP-34X-2C3 XPON stick supports 2500Base-X */
+       SFP_QUIRK_S("ODI", "DFP-34X-2C3", sfp_quirk_2500basex),
 
 	// Lantech 8330-262D-E and 8330-265D can operate at 2500base-X, but
 	// incorrectly report 2500MBd NRZ in their EEPROM.
